<title>AUSTRIA: Henkel reiterates aim to buy Loctite.</title>
<headline>Henkel reiterates aim to buy Loctite.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's chemical and consumer products Henkel KGaA group reiterated on Tuesday its aims to buy U.S. adhesive maker Loctite Corp.</p>
<p>&quot;With the aim of strengthening its international adhesives business, Henkel has decided to acquire all Loctite shares and has announced it is willing to negotiate with the aim of friendly take-over,&quot; Henkel said in a statement.</p>
<p>Henkel said last week it was launching an offer of $57.75 per share for the 65-percent stake it does not already own in Loctite. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 253</p>
</text>
